<title>CHILE: Chile's Escondida Oct copper output climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Escondida Oct copper output climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Minera Escondida Limitada reported the following copper and gold production figures for October:.</p>
<p>COPPER (metric tonnes)	Oct 96     Sept 96  Oct 95</p>
<p>Copper in concentrates	68,083     63,063   34,003</p>
<p>Copper cathodes		  3,706	4,712    3,069</p>
<p>Total			     71,789     67,775   37,072</p>
<p>			    January-Oct 1996   January-Oct 1995</p>
<p>Total			     700,398	    392,010</p>
<p>				    Oct 1996	  Oct 1995</p>
<p>GOLD (ounces)		    17,932	     8,945</p>
<p>NOTE: Minera Escondida is owned by Broken Hill Proprietary and RTZ Corp Plc.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
